118
00:09:16.667 --> 00:09:17.819
(narrator) Verse 3, the iceberg.

119
00:09:17.819 --> 00:09:26.218
(narrator) A gold public badge labels the exposed tip Interface, tagged stays the same; a sealed top secret envelope labels what is below the water: Implementation.

120
00:09:26.218 --> 00:09:31.268
(narrator) Below the waterline, turning gears give way to a yellow submarine while the tip stays fixed.

121
00:09:31.268 --> 00:09:37.306
(narrator) Three index cards switch choices below the water: array or hash table, cache or no cache, MongoDB or Supabase.

122
00:09:37.306 --> 00:09:48.724
(narrator) Then a cutaway: behind a brick wall, a framed landscape with a solar farm at noon sends current over a pylon into the wall; in a cozy room, a smiling charger plugged into the outlet charges a phone on a desk.

123
00:09:48.724 --> 00:09:51.469
