125
00:09:55.970 --> 00:10:01.020
(narrator) The outlet gets the gold Interface badge; the power plant gets a sealed top secret envelope.

126
00:10:01.627 --> 00:10:04.527
♪ Picture an iceberg. The tip’s the interface: ♪

127
00:10:04.527 --> 00:10:07.387
